{"id":"n16305-1-8","stage":4,"title":"가엾다 · 可怜","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16305-1-8-1","ko":"언니, 저 강아지가 밖에 있으니까 많이 추운가 봐.","zh":"姐姐，那只小狗在外面，看起来应该很冷吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언니,","meaning":"姐姐，大姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐，大姐","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"3","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"강아지가","meaning":"小狗，狗崽","explanation":"강아지：小狗，狗崽；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"강아지","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15689","senseId":"1","lemma":"강아지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강아지가","audio":"/audio/bd4f770201ef134f6996.mp3"}},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"外，外边","explanation":"밖：外，外边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"1","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에","audio":"/audio/b49faf879a59fe63a605.mp3"}},{"text":"있으니까","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으니까","audio":"/audio/29dd257269502abdc5be.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"추운가","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；은가：引出疑问或推测的内容，常与 보다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추운가","audio":"/audio/09e4172484adb2359b50.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐，大姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"94e82412553f09dd","term":"강아지","zh":"小狗，狗崽","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3","entryId":"15689","definition":"狗的崽子。","pronunciation":["강아지"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"越过线或界限的那边。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"大气温度低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","defi